{"type":"FeatureCollection","locode":"PHMNL","quays":["PHMNN","PHMNS"],"attribution":"© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL 1.0. https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright","position_outside":"UN/LOCODE places Manila at (14.5833, 120.9667), on the land behind South Harbor, about 160 m outside these limits.","selection_digest":"5c5d82dbd1cc9ea9dcd172268ec061e149063b27d71f5782a159c71396113a8e","features":[
{"type":"Feature","properties":{"kind":"port_limits","cargo":[],"osm":["relation/21501082","relation/14226500","way/331790315"],"source":"Derived: the convex hull of this port's terminals from OpenStreetMap, grown by 300 m, then cut to the water OpenStreetMap maps inside it (the sea within its coastline, rivers, docks and basins), with the terminals kept whole","licence":"ODbL-1.0","reviewed_at":"2026-11-23","clip":"water","disjoint":"South Harbor's basin opens to the bay west of its breakwater, beyond these limits; inside them it is parted from the mouth of the Pasig, and so from the MICT side, by a strip of land about 20 m wide.","note":"OpenStreetMap maps no port limits for Manila. These are the hull of the three container terminals below grown by 300 m, cut to the water OpenStreetMap maps inside it, with the terminals kept whole and a 30 m margin where they meet the water. What is left is the terminals, the bay off their quays and the mouth of the Pasig; Parola and Isla Puting Bato between MICT and North Harbor are cut away, all but their edges. Not all of what is left is port: MICT's own outline in OpenStreetMap takes in the Port Town Housing Project, about 4 ha with five apartment blocks, and a point for an annex of the Rosauro Almario elementary school. Next to it a 0.1 ha unnamed residential area is wholly inside, and the edges of Parola (about 0.3 ha), Diego Ville, the Gawad Kalinga village and one more area reach in, with 27 small houses at the edge of Isla Puting Bato. A scan of OpenStreetMap finds no hospitals or places of worship inside."},"geometry":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[120.96035,14.599543],[120.960343,14.599895],[120.960523,14.600137],[120.960518,14.600151],[120.958633,14.600011],[120.958635,14.600273],[120.958352,14.600253],[120.958191,14.60045],[120.958261,14.600554],[120.957767,14.600512],[120.957726,14.600623],[120.960454,14.600842],[120.960355,14.602035],[120.957786,14.601864],[120.957728,14.602711],[120.960247,14.602858],[120